@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@accessToken = 여기에 로그인 후 발급받은 access token

### 내 포토카드 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards/me?page=1&limit=10&sort=recent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 내 포토카드 필터 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards/me?keyword=테스트&grade=RARE&genre=SPECIAL&sort=price_asc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 포토카드 생성 성공
POST {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PhotoCardBoundary

--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

테스트 포토카드
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="grade"

RARE
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

SPECIAL
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="minPrice"

1000
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

포토카드 생성 API 테스트입니다.
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="totalQuantity"

10
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="photo-card.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-images/photo-card.png
--PhotoCardBoundary--

### 인증 없이 포토카드 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PhotoCardBoundary

--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

인증 없는 테스트 카드
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="grade"

RARE
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

SPECIAL
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="minPrice"

1000
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

인증 실패 테스트입니다.
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="totalQuantity"

10
--PhotoCardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="photo-card.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-images/photo-card.png
--PhotoCardBoundary--

